{"page":336,"verses":[{"verse_key":"22:31","surah":22,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"حُنَفَآءَ لِلَّهِ غَيْرَ مُشْرِكِينَ بِهِۦ ۚ وَمَن يُشْرِكْ بِٱللَّهِ فَكَأَنَّمَا خَرَّ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ فَتَخْطَفُهُ ٱلطَّيْرُ أَوْ تَهْوِى بِهِ ٱلرِّيحُ فِى مَكَانٍ سَحِيقٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Devote yourselves to God and assign Him no partners, for the person who does so is like someone who has been hurled down from the skies and snatched up by the birds or flung to a distant place by the wind.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"حُنَفَآءَ","en_gloss":"Being upright","transliteration":"ḥunafāa","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"associating partners","transliteration":"mush'rikīna","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"with Him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُشْرِكْ","en_gloss":"associates partners","transliteration":"yush'rik","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"with Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَكَأَنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then (it is) as though","transliteration":"faka-annamā","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَرَّ","en_gloss":"he had fallen","transliteration":"kharra","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَتَخْطَفُهُ","en_gloss":"and (had) snatched him","transliteration":"fatakhṭafuhu","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلطَّيْرُ","en_gloss":"the birds","transliteration":"l-ṭayru","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَهْوِى","en_gloss":"had blown","transliteration":"tahwī","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلرِّيحُ","en_gloss":"the wind","transliteration":"l-rīḥu","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مَكَانٍۢ","en_gloss":"a place","transliteration":"makānin","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":21,"ar":"سَحِيقٍۢ","en_gloss":"far off","transliteration":"saḥīqin","verse_key":"22:31"},{"pos":22,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:31"}]},{"verse_key":"22:32","surah":22,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ وَمَن يُعَظِّمْ شَعَـٰٓئِرَ ٱللَّهِ فَإِنَّهَا مِن تَقْوَى ٱلْقُلُوبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"All this [is ordained by God]: those who honour God’s rites show the piety of their hearts.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُعَظِّمْ","en_gloss":"honors","transliteration":"yuʿaẓẓim","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شَعَـٰٓئِرَ","en_gloss":"(the) Symbols","transliteration":"shaʿāira","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَإِنَّهَا","en_gloss":"then indeed, it","transliteration":"fa-innahā","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(is) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَقْوَى","en_gloss":"(the) piety","transliteration":"taqwā","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْقُلُوبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the hearts","transliteration":"l-qulūbi","verse_key":"22:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:32"}]},{"verse_key":"22:33","surah":22,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"لَكُمْ فِيهَا مَنَـٰفِعُ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى ثُمَّ مَحِلُّهَآ إِلَى ٱلْبَيْتِ ٱلْعَتِيقِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Live-stock are useful to you until the set time. Then their place of sacrifice is near the Ancient House:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"For you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَنَـٰفِعُ","en_gloss":"(are) benefits","transliteration":"manāfiʿu","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَجَلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a term","transliteration":"ajalin","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُّسَمًّۭى","en_gloss":"appointed","transliteration":"musamman","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَحِلُّهَآ","en_gloss":"their place of sacrifice","transliteration":"maḥilluhā","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"(is) at","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْتِ","en_gloss":"the House","transliteration":"l-bayti","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَتِيقِ","en_gloss":"the Ancient","transliteration":"l-ʿatīqi","verse_key":"22:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"22:33"}]},{"verse_key":"22:34","surah":22,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِكُلِّ أُمَّةٍ جَعَلْنَا مَنسَكًا لِّيَذْكُرُوا۟ ٱسْمَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَىٰ مَا رَزَقَهُم مِّنۢ بَهِيمَةِ ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ ۗ فَإِلَـٰهُكُمْ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ فَلَهُۥٓ أَسْلِمُوا۟ ۗ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلْمُخْبِتِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We appointed acts of devotion for every community, for them to celebrate God’s name over the livestock He provided for them: your God is One, so devote yourselves to Him. [Prophet], give good news to the humble","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"And for every","transliteration":"walikulli","verse_key":"22:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أُمَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"nation","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"22:34"},{"